# Normalize line endings: store text blobs as LF in the repo, regardless of each
# machine's core.autocrlf. This keeps a CRLF/LF-only change from ever showing up
# as an edit — and prevents phantom full-file diffs when syncing across machines.
# eol=lf also keeps the WORKING TREE on LF (fine for Python/Qt on Windows), which
# silences the per-file "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warning autocrlf printed on
# every git operation.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
